# all five channels at once: an A minor triad on the two pulses and the triangle, a
# noise hit on the second half-second, and the looping DPCM ramp underneath. this is
# the fixture that exercises the non-linear mixer's cross-channel behaviour — the
# triangle and noise are ducked by the DPCM level through the shared TND table.
